    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 3 Sandymount sits on an elevated site overlooking Newport Quay. The property, which was built in the 1970s, has undergone extensive modernisation and refurbishment throughout, including pumped cavities, PVC double glazing and general decoration, and now presents an excellent opportunity for a discerning purchaser seeking a well-appointed home in a superb location.\r\nInternally, the property presents in very good condition. On ground floor level, the entrance hall leads to a bright sitting room with excellent views over Newport Quay. This room features a new log burner stove, creating a warm and inviting focal point. The dining area and kitchen have been reconfigured to create a modern open-plan living space, ideal for contemporary family living and entertaining. Access is available to the rear garden, where there is a small storage shed plumbed for a washing machine and dryer.\r\nAt first floor level, there are three good-sized bedrooms and a shower room. All rooms located to the front of the property enjoy spectacular views over Newport Quay, Newport House and part of Newport town.\r\nExternally, there is a small lawn to the front of the property, with a side access gate leading to a stepped rear garden.\r\nNewport is a popular tourist town with a good range of amenities, including shops, primary school, restaurants and hotels.\r\nThe property is situated along the popular Great Western Greenway cycle and walking trail, which runs from Westport town to Achill Island, with a wide range of leisure facilities on its doorstep. Westport town is a ten-minute drive, while Castlebar is within fifteen minutes of the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR:\r\nHallway: \t\t4.08m x 1.73m\r\nLiving Room:\t\t4.14m x 3.94m\r\nDining Room:\t\t3.07m x 3.93m\r\nKitchen:\t\t3.02m x 2.83m\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\nLanding:\t\t1.60m x 3.17m\r\nShower Room:\t\t2.36m x 1.69m\r\nBedroom 1:\t\t3.56m x 3.36m\r\nHotpress:\t\t0.58m x 1.67m\r\nBedroom 2:\t\t3.54m x 3.95m\r\nBedroom 3:\t\t2.94m x 2.38m\r\n\r\nApprox Internal Floor Area: c.87 sq.m (c.936 sq.ft)\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nWater:\t\tMains\r\nSewage:\tMains\r\nHeating:\tOil fired central heating & solid fuel stove with back boiler\r\nElectricity:\tMains"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "\tSpectacular views overlooking Newport Quay\r\n\tTurnkey semi-detached home in excellent condition\r\n\tSuperb garden room – ideal as a home office, gym or studio\r\n\tPrime location within walking distance of Newport town amenities\r\n\tPumped cavity insulation, PVC double glazing, OFCH & solid-fuel stove with back boiler\r\n\tIdeal first home, downsizer or low-maintenance holiday retreat"
